title: "Note_taker: From-Scratch Transformers for Punctuation Restoration and Extractive Meeting Notes"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vachier
    given-names: Jeremy
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
keywords:
  - keras
  - jax
