  - meeting-notes
  - extractive-summarization
  - punctuation-restoration
  - truecasing
abstract: >-
  Two small transformer models built from scratch with Keras 3 on the JAX backend: a 7.3M-parameter
  model that restores punctuation and casing in speech-to-text output, and a 20.9M-parameter
  hierarchical model that extracts decisions, action items and key points from meeting
  transcripts. Published on the Hugging Face Hub as punctuation-casing-en-7m and
  meeting-notes-en-21m.
